From 1a67b5b70ef51fea71d0ed34948f98ec2a9da5f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] FreeChat: disappearing messages vanish locally; messages
 stay off disk

Expiry markers are honoured to the second and purged messages are dropped
after an existence check; redacted messages are hidden. The event and media
caches are deleted when a session is restored, and the local search index is
not built. Untested: needs a Mac to build.
